Every raw hex maps to a primitive token
 Every component uses only applied/component tokens
 Semantic names are theme-agnostic
 Neutral palette uses warm-gray family — no cool grays
 Primary action is #191919 (monochrome), not blue
 All 12 font sizes (10–36px) are available
 Bold (700) weight exists for display/hero
 Slate palette is only for data table/audit views
 Buttons: default, hover, pressed, focus-visible, disabled, loading states
 Text contrast: WCAG 4.5:1 body, 3:1 large/controls
 Focus uses color.border.focus (#191919)
 Modal backdrop: rgba(0,0,0,0.20)
 Disabled opacity: 0.42
 Reduced-motion honored
 4px spacing grid with half-steps
 No component references primitives directly — always through semantic